From 72cfd8024f6172bbd54d424db3946e2933be6daa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 04:50:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02267/11362] [outer-loop] robust local induction: max_tokens
 2048->4096 + parse-validate-and-retry + defensive load

gemma-4-12B wrote real cd82 game logic but truncated at 2048 tokens (syntax error -> crash).
Fixes: max_tokens 4096 (engines need >2048); _gen_to_file ast.parse-validates + retries 3x
on unparseable/no-engine output (GPU = fast); script wraps load_engine so a bad engine is a
graceful failure, not a crash. The local GPU server path is otherwise working (it generated
real dynamics code).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
